{
  "id": "electric_wire___calculating_cross_section_areas",
  "title": "Electric Wire - Calculating Cross-Section Areas",
  "description": "Calculate single and bunched electric wire cross-section area and diameter.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Cross-Section Area of Single Wire\n\nThe cross-section area of a round single wire can be calculated as:\n\n**A = D² π / 4 = 0.7854 D²**\n\nwhere:\n- A = cross-section area (mm²)\n- D = diameter (mm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Single Wire Cross-Section Area"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "single_wire_diameter",
          "label": "Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "single_wire_area",
          "label": "Cross-Section Area",
          "formula": "inputs.single_wire_diameter * inputs.single_wire_diameter * 3.14159265359 / 4",
          "unit": "mm²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Cross-Section Area of Bunched Wire\n\nThe cross-section area of bunched wires can be calculated as:\n\n**A = n d² π / 4 = 0.7854 n d²**\n\nwhere:\n- n = number of wires\n- d = single wire diameter (mm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Multiple Wires Cross-Section Area"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "bunch_wire_diameter",
          "label": "Diameter of each wire",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "number_of_wires",
          "label": "Number of wires",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "bunched_wire_area",
          "label": "Cross-Section Area",
          "formula": "inputs.number_of_wires * inputs.bunch_wire_diameter * inputs.bunch_wire_diameter * 3.14159265359 / 4",
          "unit": "mm²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Diameter of a Single Wire Cross-Section Area\n\nThe diameter of a single wire cross-section area can be calculated as:\n\n**D = (A × 4 / π)^(1/2) = (1.2732 A)^(1/2)**\n\nwhere:\n- A = cross-section area (mm²)\n- D = diameter (mm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Diameter from Cross-Section Area"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "cross_section_area",
          "label": "Cross-Section Area",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm²",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "calculated_diameter",
          "label": "Diameter",
          "formula": "Math.sqrt(inputs.cross_section_area * 4 / 3.14159265359)",
          "unit": "mm",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}